<title>UK: Kingfisher unit to get new MD.</title>
<headline>Kingfisher unit to get new MD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail group Kingfisher Plc said on Wednesday it has appointed Jim Glover as deputy managing director of subsidiary Woolworths.</p>
<p>Glover will become managing director at Woolworths when Roger Jones retires in the autumn.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
